I, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَأَبْصِرْهُمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/031a7445344bd89e2e42.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i posmatraj ih", "en": "and watch them", "tr": "ve onları gözle", "fr": "et observe-les", "id": "dan tunggulah mereka", "ur": "اور انہیں دیکھتے رہو", "bn": "এবং তাদের লক্ষ্য করো", "fa": "و آنان را بنگر"}}, {"text": "فَسَوْفَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُبْصِرُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/4da748f15c2c50b10bb1.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "vidjet će", "en": "they will see", "tr": "göreceklerdir", "fr": "ils verront", "id": "mereka akan melihat", "ur": "وہ دیکھ لیں گے", "bn": "তারা দেখবে", "fa": "خواهند دید"}}]}, {"ref": "69:39", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5362.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And all that ye see not", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ve görmediklerinize..", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور جنہیں تم نہیں دیکھتے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan dengan apa yang tidak kamu lihat.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُبْصِرُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/517b20b5921ed54637ad.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you (all) see", "bs": "vidite", "tr": "görüyorsunuz", "fr": "vous voyez", "id": "kalian melihat", "ur": "تم دیکھتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা দেখ", "fa": "می‌بینید"}}]}, {"ref": "37:179", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3967.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And watch, for they will (soon) see.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "(